  "Readonly host handbook/annex/p15/martingales-and-convergence.tex 90-91, 160, 239-243 and editable host handbook/annex/p15/martingale-maximal-inequalities.tex 57-59 keep compressed deferrals ('identical with their respective signs', 'uses the opposite sign', 'bounded-level conditional comparison argument', 'reverses the inequalities', test-set sentence); the owned file writes the full arguments, which become the route's proofs only after routing.",
  "Owned annex handbook/annex/p15/martingales-stopping-and-sequential-random-constructions-w02c-p15-019.tex 59: the annexitem title of the multistep-definition proof is 'Gaps', which does not describe the proof (cosmetic).",
